  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Expected behavior:\nObjects comprising local players cast shadows in cameras similar to a player's view.\n\nActual behavior:\nObjects comprising local players do not cast shadows on cameras.\n\"Cameras\" means both photo camera and Camera components in avatars.\n\nTo reproduce, I used a world for reporting another issue.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/culling-mask-for-lights-in-avatars-modified-unexpectedly\n\n1st picture describes the avatar setup. It contains a green directional light.\n2nd picture is the player's view. A sphere in the PlayerLocal layer is casting a  shadow.\n3rd picture shows the photo camera view. Both spheres in the PlayerLocal layer or the MirrorReflection layer are not casting shadows.\n\nEnvironment:\n- VRChat build 1231 (live) and 1236 (beta)",
